
# Crossworld Travel Solutions – GMNP Website

Official website for **Crossworld Travel Solutions** promoting the  
**Global Medics NHS Programme (GMNP)**.

---

## 🌍 About The Project

This is a responsive promotional website built using:

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Font Awesome Icons
- Google Fonts
- Basic JavaScript

The website provides information about:

- GMNP Programme
- Training & Courses
- Post PLAB Support
- Success Stories
- Contact Information

---

## 🚀 Live Features

✔ Fixed professional header  
✔ Smooth scrolling navigation  
✔ Hero section with overlay image  
✔ Apply Now button (Google Form integration)  
✔ WhatsApp floating button  
✔ Social media integration  
✔ Responsive design for mobile devices  

